### What I Learned

This project helped me practice using lists and dictionaries in Python. I learned how to go through a list of dictionaries and compare different values using dictionary keys.

I also learned how starting salaries compare to salaries after two years in the Bureau of Labor Statistics data. The program allows me to look at different occupations and states to see which jobs have the highest salaries.

